## Introduction

**Entity** = persistance. **DTO** = transfert (API, messages).

## Concept

```ts
// Entity
type UserEntity = {
  id: string;
  email: string;
  passwordHash: string;
  role: "admin" | "user";
};

// DTO public
type UserDto = {
  id: string;
  email: string;
  role: "admin" | "user";
};

function toUserDto(entity: UserEntity): UserDto {
  const { passwordHash: _, ...dto } = entity;
  return dto;
}
```

